        <reference target="https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7265" anchor="RFC7265">
          <front>
            <title>jCal: The JSON Format for iCalendar</title>
            <author fullname="P. Kewisch" asciiFullname="P. Kewisch"></author>
            <author fullname="C. Daboo" asciiFullname="C. Daboo"></author>
            <author fullname="M. Douglass" asciiFullname="M. Douglass"></author>
            <date month="May" year="2014"></date>
            <abstract>
              <t>This specification defines "jCal", a JSON format for iCalendar data. The iCalendar data format is a text format for capturing and exchanging information normally stored within a calendaring and scheduling application, for example, tasks and events.  JSON is a lightweight, text-based, language-independent data interchange format commonly used in Internet applications.</t>
            </abstract>
          </front>
          <format target="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/relaton/relaton-data-ietf/master/data/reference.RFC.7265.xml" type="xml"></format>
